{"id":"s13","label":"13. A Garden-Arbor","blocks":[{"k":"d","text":"MARGARET comes in, conceals herself behind the door, puts her finger to her lips, and peeps through the crack."},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["He comes!"]},{"k":"s","text":"FAUST"},{"k":"d","text":"entering"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, rogue! a tease thou art:","I have thee!"]},{"k":"d","text":"He kisses her."},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"d","text":"clasping him, and returning the kiss"},{"k":"v","lines":["Dearest man! I love thee from my heart."]},{"k":"d","text":"MEPHISTOPHELES knocks"},{"k":"s","text":"FAUST"},{"k":"d","text":"stamping his foot"},{"k":"v","lines":["Who’s there?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MEPHISTOPHELES"},{"k":"v","lines":["A friend!"]},{"k":"s","text":"FAUST"},{"k":"v","lines":["A beast!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MEPHISTOPHELES"},{"k":"v","lines":["’Tis time to separate."]},{"k":"s","text":"MARTHA"},{"k":"d","text":"coming"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, Sir, ’tis late."]},{"k":"s","text":"FAUST"},{"k":"v","lines":["May I not, then, upon you wait?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["My mother would—farewell!"]},{"k":"s","text":"FAUST"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, can I not remain?","Farewell!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MARTHA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Adieu!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["And soon to meet again!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exeunt FAUST and MEPHISTOPHELES."},{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"v","lines":["Dear God! However is it, such","A man can think and know so much?","I stand ashamed and in amaze,","And answer “Yes” to all he says,","A poor, unknowing child! and he—","I can’t think what he finds in me!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."}]}